{"id":71193,"date":"2026-10-28T09:32:01","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:32:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71193"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:34:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:34:02","slug":"grande-premio-de-atletismo-a-do-barbas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-de-atletismo-a-do-barbas\/","title":{"rendered":"35\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo A-do-Barbas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">35\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo A-do-Barbas 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>35\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo A-do-Barbas 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente <strong>Memorial Fernando Figueiredo<\/strong>) realiza-se na ter\u00e7a-feira (feriado), <strong>8 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> junto \u00e0 sede do <strong>Centro Popular e Recreativo de A-do-Barbas<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Maceira<\/strong>, concelho e distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Integrada no Circuito de Meio-Fundo da ADAL, a prova est\u00e1 limitada a <strong>500 participantes<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada Rota da Tofeira (~8 km)<\/strong> por caminhos e trilhos locais (Tofeira, Forno da Cal, Tanque da Mina e Trilho da Leiteira), seguida a partir das <strong>09h30<\/strong> pelas <strong>Provas Jovens<\/strong> (10 partidas entre 100 m e 3.200 m). \u00c0s <strong>11h15<\/strong> parte a <strong>Prova Principal de 10 km (10.000 m com medi\u00e7\u00e3o certificada)<\/strong> e vertente de Atletismo Adaptado, com tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de <strong>1h50m<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo <strong>Centro Popular e Recreativo de A-do-Barbas (CPR A-do-Barbas)<\/strong> em coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria (ADAL)<\/strong> e com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Leiria e da Junta de Freguesia de Maceira. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt\/brinde desportivo, pr\u00e9mio surpresa, abastecimentos aos 5 km e na meta, e banhos nos Balne\u00e1rios do Campo do Hortel\u00e3o. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sede do CPR de A-do-Barbas, Maceira, Leiria<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-te